{
  "name": "Rendley — Multi-Aspect Fan-Out",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## One Master → Every Aspect Ratio\n\nGive one finished master project. This fan-out loops over **9:16, 1:1, 4:5 and 16:9**, reframes the project to each ratio with subject tracking, exports an MP4 per ratio, and copies each to your storage.\n\n**Set up:** put your finished project's ID in the **Set Master Project** node, then run.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Credits\nReframing runs subject detection on every clip and each ratio is a separate export — both need a **paid Rendley plan** and consume **credits**. Budget **~30–80 credits per ratio**, so a full 4-ratio fan-out is roughly **~120–320 credits**.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Plan and cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why one ratio at a time?\nFor a single long job, the simplest pattern is **Wait for Completion** on the node itself. A fan-out is the exception: each branch must stay bound to its own aspect ratio, Reframing sequentially (reframe → export → next ratio) keeps each ratio isolated, so here we let the node wait inline with **Wait for Completion**.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Why inline",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        680
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Links expire — copy each file!\nRendley **export URLs expire after ~4 hours** and **presigned media URLs after ~3 hours**. Every loop iteration downloads its MP4 and re-uploads it to your own Google Drive so all four ratios are safely stored.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Expiry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        680
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "project_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "YOUR_MASTER_PROJECT_ID"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Set Master Project",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        60,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const projectId = $input.first().json.project_id;\nreturn ['9:16', '1:1', '4:5', '16:9'].map((ratio) => ({\n  json: { project_id: projectId, ratio },\n}));"
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Fan Out Ratios",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        280,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Loop Over Ratios",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        500,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "edit",
        "operation": "reframe",
        "projectId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.project_id }}"
        },
        "editOptions": {
          "aspectRatio": "={{ $json.ratio }}"
        },
        "renderAfter": true,
        "renderSettings": {
          "target_resolution": "1080p",
          "quality": "high"
        },
        "waitForCompletion": true
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Rendley — Reframe + Export",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        720
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.video_url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Download MP4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upload",
        "name": "={{ 'reframe-' + ($json.ratio || $('Loop Over Ratios').item.json.ratio).replace(':','x') + '.mp4' }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016",
      "name": "Save to Google Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        940,
        720
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "cc000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017",
      "name": "All Ratios Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Run": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
